  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7461e2480208d4f9ea4aba32f286ead4, type: 2}
    text: I used to live by the sea, until a monster came and ate my wife.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7461e2480208d4f9ea4aba32f286ead4, type: 2}
    text: I blocked the path to it for everyones safety, I'm only telling you this
      so you don't try and go visit
